2. **Sintering temperature reduction**: The addition of Si doping can help reduce the sintering temperature required to achieve a uniform and dense structure. This is because Si doping can enhance the densification process by promoting the formation of new grain boundaries and reducing the activation energy required for grain boundary motion.  
