   \[
   \text{Required moles} = 30.0 \, \text{mol} - 10.0 \, \text{mol} = 20.0 \, \text{mol}
   \]

4. **Calculate the volume of 6.00 M H\(_2\)SO\(_4\) required:**
   \[
   \text{Volume (L)} = \frac{\text{Moles}}{\text{Molarity}} = \frac{20.0 \, \text{mol}}{6.00 \, \text{M}} = 3.33 \, \text{L}
   \]

**Final Answer:**
\[
\boxed{3.33 \, \text{L}}
\]
