   - Time for Liu: \(100 \text{ cm} / 450 \text{ cm/minute} = \frac{1}{4.5} \text{ minute} \approx 0.22 \text{ minute}\)

4. **Convert to minutes:**
   - \(0.22 \text{ minute} \times 60 = 12.2 \text{ minutes}\)

5. **Convert to the nearest whole minute:**
   - \(12.2 \text{ minutes} \approx 12 \text{ minutes}\)

