\[
\lambda = d \sin \theta \implies \sin \theta = \frac{\lambda}{d} = \frac{600 \times 10^{-9}}{1.2 \times 10^{-6}} = 0.5
\]

\[
\theta = \sin^{-1}(0.5) = 30^\circ
\]

Thus, the angle between the central maximum and the third order maximum is \(\boxed{30^\circ}\).
